Exit codes:
  0   ok                    the requested operation succeeded; for verify,
                            checked and passed. Not a claim that everything
                            referenced is valid
  1   checked and wrong     a check ran to completion and found something wrong:
                            verify's comparison disagreed, a gate (hub check,
                            pull) refused at least one object, fsck made a fatal
                            finding, or a writer refused a request its check
                            over the statements held decided (a rule the
                            publisher named failing its bytes; a revocation that
                            would undo itself), so holding more statements would
                            not change the answer. What a gate admitted beside a
                            refusal is still committed (pull) and said so
  2   did not start         the invocation or the reader's own configuration
                            could not be acted on: unknown option, malformed
                            argument, unreadable or unparseable policy, no
                            store. Nothing ran and nothing was committed
  3   could not check       contested, unknown, unchecked, unpinned,
                            unsupported, an optional capability not configured,
                            a reader limit, or a failure after work started
  4   nothing to re-run     the derivation names an input it did not pin
  5   environment mismatch  the declared environment differs from, or is not
                            available in, the one that ran
